  "body": "Positioned in one of Auckland's most tightly held blue-chip waterfront enclaves, this exceptional 228m² penthouse within the prestigious Satori Apartments delivers a rare blend of architectural refinement, space, and uninterrupted lifestyle luxury.\r\n\r\nInspired by Japanese principles of balance and simplicity, Satori is an exclusive boutique development of just 17 residences, designed by award-winning architects to create calm, privacy, and enduring quality above the tranquil surrounds of Awarua Reserve.\r\n\r\nFramed by sweeping 180-degree views across Orakei Basin, Hobson Bay, and the Auckland city skyline, this home captures a constantly shifting canvas of water, light, and golden sunsets. Expansive open-plan living flows to a north-west facing covered balcony, where uninterrupted views stretch across the city skyline that are best enjoyed as the sun sets and the harbour begins to glow.\r\n\r\nThe residence features four double bedrooms, including two with walk-in wardrobes, three beautifully appointed bathrooms, and a refined scullery for seamless day-to-day functionality.  From multiple rooms throughout the home, you can watch the city come alive each evening, creating a rare sense of connection between ocean, landscape, and urban energy.\r\n\r\nResidents also enjoy access to a beautifully designed Satori lounge, a private shared space ideal for entertaining guests, hosting gatherings, or simply stepping away from the everyday.\r\n\r\nA car elevator provides direct access to the basement level, complemented by two secure, dedicated car parks, offering both exclusivity and convenience.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Orakei Bay Village, coastal walkways, eastern beaches, and only minutes to the CBD, this address offers the ultimate balance between waterfront retreat and city convenience.\r\n\r\nOpportunities within Satori are exceptionally rare. This is not just a residence, it is a statement of scale, serenity, and waterfront prestige in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal addresses.\r\n\r\nTo book a private viewing or for more information, contact the exclusive listing agents Rosie & Daniel Deans on 021 288 6333.\r\n\r\nDownload property documents here; https://vltre.co/eXU0Qx",
